        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, heat production system, specific heat demand 30W</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, heat production system, specific heat demand 30W
Disposal of an average heat production system for a building with a specific heat demand of 30 W per m2 heated gross floor area;
UUID: db8e09ad-7f13-4a53-b76f-10a80ea1d4c5
Metals not included (cut-off to recycling); for other materials: disposal process according to waste material type; no transports included.
Location: Specific to the technology mix for waste treatment encountered in Switzerland.
Technology: Metal parts are recycled (cut off), plastic parts are incinerated, paint to final disposal, inert wastes (e.g. rock or glass wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material for average investigated in 2008. Process information partly from 1994 to 2003. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_db8e09ad-7f13-4a53-b76f-10a80ea1d4c5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
